# Private / reverse-engineering material — not for public distribution.
# Rationale: these document HOW to bypass Qoder's request signing (210 char
# offsets, COSY material, WASM internals). Interoperability research is lawful
# in most jurisdictions, but publishing a reproducible bypass invites both
# takedown requests and hostile attention. Kept locally; see
# docs/DOCS-PUBLIC-POLICY.md for the full classification.
docs/QODER-PROTOCOL.md
docs/QODER-PROTOCOL-FINDINGS.md
docs/CODEBUDDY-ARCHITECTURE.md
docs/analysis-cosy-material.md
docs/cosy-signature-analysis.md
docs/experiment-endpoint-election.md
docs/umid-analysis.md
docs/MODEL-LIST-SIGNATURE-LOG.md
docs/DOCS-PUBLIC-POLICY.md
docs/SECURITY-PREPUSH-AUDIT.md

